:"https://api.github.com/users/FlorianPfaff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlorianPfaff/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlorianPfaff/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlorianPfaff/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlorianPfaff/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlorianPfaff/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-gtar","state":"uploaded","size":14653964,"digest":"sha256:17c16d8ee9c628f33346e61bbbc065eba6830afb10c54a686b5c8ac3eeb85c5c","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-16T06:55:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:55:51Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/FlorianPfaff/orbit-smoothing-poc/releases/download/v4-shifted-02/segmented-v4-shifted02-full-capture.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlorianPfaff/orbit-smoothing-poc/tarball/v4-shifted-02","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlorianPfaff/orbit-smoothing-poc/zipball/v4-shifted-02","body":"This prerelease preserves the separately audited shifted-cut diagnostic against validation04. It is not the v4.0 release or the 68-fit benchmark.\n\nBoth one-hour synthetic captured linearizations passed fresh MAP, covariance, residual-energy and deterministic-equation checks: 24 proposal solves and 8 undamped covariance solves, with no physical propagation or nuisance refit. The largest MAP discrepancy was 2.2442e-12 posterior standard deviations; the largest relative covariance discrepancy was 9.1396e-14.\n\nThe 1,800-second offsets provide genuine interior-parameter movement for both methods and segment periods. The 300-second pulse offsets provide no cut-coverage evidence; their numerical agreement remains reported. These checks do not establish multi-day or flight equivalence, accepted-fit covariance, a speedup, or release readiness. The benchmark remains 0/68 in this dated diagnostic record; the original v3.1 campaign remains separate.\n\nThe attached archive preserves all 109 compact-capture files plus their manifest, including 48 numerical payload files. SHA-256:\n\n`17c16d8ee9c628f33346e61bbbc065eba6830afb10c54a686b5c8ac3eeb85c5c`\n\nThe 32 shifted and 4 original weighted-row files remain at their separately hashed external locations and are not included in this archive. The report explicitly lists all external evidence. Earlier control/parser failures and the publication-only empty-readback issue are retained; no scientific limits changed.\n\nSee [PR #5](https://github.com/FlorianPfaff/orbit-smoothing-poc/pull/5) and `validation/segmented-v4/shifted02/index.html` for the report.\n"}